# Operator names are case-sensitive: `Take` is DS0104 with a fix.
mode: syntax
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | Take 5
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..27
  PIPELINE@0..26
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
    LITERAL@5..17
      STRING@5..17 "'orders.csv'"
    WHITESPACE@17..18 " "
    PIPE@18..19 "|"
    WHITESPACE@19..20 " "
    TAKE_OP@20..26
      IDENT@20..24 "Take"
      WHITESPACE@24..25 " "
      LITERAL@25..26
        LONG@25..26 "5"
  WHITESPACE@26..27 "\n"

error[DS0104]: unknown operator `Take`
  --> query:1:21
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | Take 5
  |                     ^^^^ operator names are case-sensitive
  |
  = help: write `take`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    from 'orders.csv' | take 5
which parses without errors
